WEBVTT

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:36.800
<i>I saw this in a movie once.</i>

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:42.640
<i>The main character, a child, closed his eyes at every tunnel.</i>

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:47.220
<i>"After you pass through a tunnel and open your eyes,</i>

00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:48.810
<i>your wish will be granted."</i>

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:51.030
<i>That's what he believed.</i>

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:55.950
<i>After I pass through this tunnel,</i>

00:00:56.860 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>will you be there?</i>

00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:05.000
<i>Joonsang, do you remember?</i>

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:10.920
<i>Our first time at the ocean.</i>

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:14.760
<i>Should we go see the ocean?</i>

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:51.310
<i>As time passes,</i>

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:56.280
<i>forgetting things is not as difficult as you think it is.</i>

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:00.740
<i>The person I see in this picture</i>

00:03:01.910 --> 00:03:06.080
<i>looks so strange, that I feel it isn't me.</i>

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:07.910
What are you doing there?

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.900
I'm going up to Seoul right now.

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:14.420
Is there anything you need?

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:16.590
The materials have been ordered,

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:18.590
and the refrigerator is stocked.

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:20.380
Come back after a few days of rest.

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:24.680
I'm not quite sure who's worrying about whom right now.

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:26.140
Well, putting that aside...

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.900
I put your favorite in the living room,

00:03:29.900 --> 00:03:31.440
so take a look when your mood changes.

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:33.480
Well, I'm going!

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:34.480
Manager Kim.{was: Senpai}

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:37.070
You know I'm grateful, don't you?

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:40.360
I'm tearing up.

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:44.660
I even forced you to quit work. I'm sorry.

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:50.450
Grateful or sorry. Pick one or the other.

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:54.460
Oh, yeah. Isn't the bazaar today?

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:57.170
You're right. Did I forget about it?

00:03:58.130 --> 00:04:01.670
What are you doing? Hurry up and get ready. I'll take you.

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:04.220
"I'm not going to forget in five days.

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:06.220
I'll keep it all up here." Didn't you say that?

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:07.180
My friend.

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:10.810
As I listen, I'll take a good look at your face as well.

00:04:12.430 --> 00:04:14.600
I have to memorize it perfectly.

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:26.030
Well, I remember that they took all the film and pictures.

00:04:27.570 --> 00:04:30.740
Then the person that I was with at the time...

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:34.410
It wasn't the groom. Even though it's hazy after three years...

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:37.290
Was it the day after the shoot?

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:40.800
At daybreak, a clean-cut man came by,

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:43.590
claiming that the groom had sent him.

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:51.430
<i>Make sure it comes out nice, okay?{ep17, 17:56}</i>

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:55.090
You look great right now.

00:04:55.090 --> 00:04:56.980
Yes, like that, like that, like that.

00:04:57.150 --> 00:04:59.860
Sir, if you'd turn your head a little to the left.

00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:01.570
Good, hold it right there.

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:05.780
Now, if the prospective groom would close his mouth a bit.

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:06.910
Good. Taking it now.

00:05:07.610 --> 00:05:10.150
I have to say, you two really look alike.

00:05:10.150 --> 00:05:12.540
You must love each other a lot.

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:13.790
Do we?

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:15.500
Here I go, then!

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:25.010
That's right!

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:31.350
I just remembered. I saw him last week in Bupyung.

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:33.350
Who did you see?

00:05:34.220 --> 00:05:34.270
Who else? The prospective groom!

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:37.060
Who else? The prospective groom!

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:41.570
Is that true? Sir, is that true?

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:56.540
<i>I really thought I'd seen that face before.</i>

00:05:56.910 --> 00:05:59.920
<i>When I saw your face, miss, I remembered everything.</i>

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:05.760
<i>But he wasn't exactly the same.</i>

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:08.470
<i>But he wasn't exactly the same.</i>

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:11.800
<i>His eyes looked somewhat dim.</i>

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:14.930
<i>I don't remember them being like that before...</i>

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:19.810
Wow, this is really cool.

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:35.990
Sis, let's go over there!

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:37.700
Okay, okay, let's go.

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:40.080
Wait for me!

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.170
Wait for me!

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:49.840
Are you all right?

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:53.970
You're hurt.

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:56.140
What should we do?

00:06:58.230 --> 00:06:58.980
Are you all right?

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:03.400
Are you hurt?

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:14.830
Here they are.

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:16.790
Thanks.

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:30.340
Here, take them.

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:34.970
He's so lucky.

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:40.270
Thank you very much.

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:48.230
Tasty.

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:53.860
Oh, they're so good.

00:07:57.030 --> 00:07:58.080
Whoa, there's candy over there too!

00:07:58.080 --> 00:07:59.580
Let's go over there, sir!

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:09.170
There's lots!

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:11.010
Yeah, really!

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:15.510
Wait for me, Sis!

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:17.010
Yeah, hurry up!

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:22.270
Have one.

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:29.690
Sis!

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:31.360
Hurry up!

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:45.540
Oh, you look so beautiful.

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:48.040
Do you have the time?

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:25.160
J-Joonsang.

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:34.710
Joonsang!

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:51.900
Joonsang...

00:10:02.990 --> 00:10:04.120
Joonsang...

00:10:07.660 --> 00:10:08.790
Joonsang!

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:36.070
Wow, that's really cool.

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:38.360
I want to live in it.

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:40.280
Look at it.

00:10:49.910 --> 00:10:51.040
An impossible house?

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:52.420
Yeah.

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:56.590
Daddy always used to say that a loving heart is the best home that{ep17, 19:27}

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:58.260
two loving people could have.

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:03.900
I want to actually build a house that contains in it

00:11:03.900 --> 00:11:05.680
all the warmth of a loving heart.

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:07.560
Sounds ridiculous, doesn't it?

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:10.060
No, I want to help you do it.

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:12.790
I've got quite a few sketches of it done,

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:15.440
but I always get stuck when I actually try to design it.

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:17.910
I'd like to take a stab at designing it too,

00:11:17.910 --> 00:11:19.740
if it'll really be the kind of house you say it'll be.

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:22.030
It's a promise then!

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:29.290
<i>And Yujin...{ep19, 19:16}</i>

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:31.960
<i>let's...</i>

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:35.000
<i>never meet again.</i>

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:40.220
<i>Let's just cherish the time we spent at the ocean as our last</i>

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:44.720
<i>and never meet again, savoring only those good times we had.</i>

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:57.170
<i>The coins are in a summertime mood{ep17, 20:53}</i>

00:11:57.170 --> 00:11:58.780
<i>even though it's still winter here, aren't they?</i>

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:00.940
What should we do with this money?{ep17, 20:58}

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:02.900
I don't know.

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:06.620
Why don't we pick up a lot more of them and buy a boat like this one?

00:12:06.740 --> 00:12:07.200
A boat?

00:12:07.780 --> 00:12:09.080
That's right.

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:13.080
Then we could just wander the seas together our whole life

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:14.620
and never come back.

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:17.460
But you'll have to come back some time.

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:51.400
<i>Now it's your turn.{ep4, 10:48}</i>

00:13:51.400 --> 00:13:52.720
<i>Favorite flower?</i>

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:54.270
<i>A white rose.</i>

00:13:56.480 --> 00:13:57.980
<i>I wanted to memorize your answers.{ep4, 10:29}</i>

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:02.860
<i>I want to memorize everything you like.</i>

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:13.330
<i>Yujin...</i>

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:19.250
<i>I couldn't keep my promise, and I left without a word,</i>

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:21.960
<i>but you still waited for me until the end.</i>

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:24.210
<i>Now it's my turn.</i>

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:27.550
<i>You can say it's an impossible house,</i>

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:31.640
<i>a design that can't be finished without you,</i>

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:33.680
<i>but I won't give up.</i>

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:16.820
Who is it?

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:24.080
Who is it?

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:33.470
Is that you, Yujin?

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:38.430
Is that you, Joonsang?

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:43.560
Yujin...

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:09.000
Just settle for this!

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:10.880
What are you talking about?

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:14.630
Jihyun's mother, I am the <i>designer</i> of this dress.

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:18.390
Do you seriously think the tiara will work with this dress?

00:17:18.800 --> 00:17:21.220
Hey, do designers make mistakes?

00:17:21.850 --> 00:17:24.390
This is a perfect accessory for this dress.

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:27.020
You're so stubborn.

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:28.900
Shouldn't you back down while I'm being nice?

00:17:29.020 --> 00:17:30.060
And what if I say I won't?

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:31.480
Stop already.

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:33.400
I can just put on both, can't I?

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:35.320
You stay out of it.

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:37.660
What'd you just say? Two tiaras?

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:41.780
Oh, wow, look at you. Who are you yelling at?

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:44.660
Yujin is the main character today.

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:45.870
Did I say anything?

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:47.540
So you give up!

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:49.040
I made that dress!

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:51.460
Jeez, you really <i>are</i> special, aren't you, Miss Designer?

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:53.170
Then, why don't you design one instead?

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:16.030
Is that okay?

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:17.200
Thanks.

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:19.360
What are you doing here alone?

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:20.200
What about Chelin?

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:28.870
It feels like something's missing.

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:30.250
What?

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:37.550
Jane told me you'd received it, but it really is true.

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:58.110
Joonsang...

00:19:04.740 --> 00:19:06.240
Hey, Sanghyuk, grab her!

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:08.330
No, Jihyun, don't! No!

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:11.080
Jihyun, you can't go over there!

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:13.500
It's dangerous.

00:19:17.090 --> 00:19:20.470
She's so disobedient. I wonder who she takes after.

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:23.390
She's just like her disobedient father.

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:27.180
What's up? Why are you looking like that?

00:19:28.470 --> 00:19:30.100
Did she just go?

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:31.440
Let me see.

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:33.060
Hey?! She did!

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:35.940
Hurry! Get a diaper.

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:37.530
Honey! {lit. Jihyun's mom}

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:42.200
Jinsook! Argh, seriously, she went just now!

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:50.710
I've committed great wrongs against both of you up till now.

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:55.080
Please don't say such things, Mother.

00:19:58.880 --> 00:20:00.510
Can you forgive me?

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:03.840
Mother...

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:20.190
Thank you.

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:23.450
Don't worry about it. It feels strange

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:27.160
that I'm walking you down the aisle instead of Hyunsook.

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:32.370
Do you want to practice right now?

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:36.500
We can decide the speed and pace we should use.

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:40.420
Aren't we a little too late? It'll begin in a moment.

00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:42.010
Father.

00:20:44.550 --> 00:20:45.840
I'll do it.

00:20:47.090 --> 00:20:49.390
What have you been doing up until now, if not practicing?

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:53.560
Go ahead to the ceremony, and leave Yujin to me.

00:21:03.570 --> 00:21:05.990
Yujin, I'll be outside.

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:34.430
Oh!

00:21:34.930 --> 00:21:37.600
Joonsang, Yujin, congratulations on the wedding.

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:39.060
Congratulations, Yujin!

00:21:39.190 --> 00:21:40.320
Isn't our daughter beautiful?

00:21:40.320 --> 00:21:43.330
If you two have a really handsome son, we'll get them married.

00:21:43.330 --> 00:21:44.900
How does that sound? Great, huh?

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:47.360
Oh you, just don't cry on that day.

00:21:49.030 --> 00:21:50.700
Joonsang Kang, Yujin Jung...

00:21:51.660 --> 00:21:52.910
Congratulations on the wedding.

00:21:54.250 --> 00:21:55.500
Really.

00:22:10.140 --> 00:22:11.550
They're taking too long.

00:22:12.850 --> 00:22:14.430
Dear, it's Yujin!

00:22:14.930 --> 00:22:17.520
Oh, my, why is she so beautiful?

00:23:52.740 --> 00:23:54.370
I, Joonsang Kang,

00:23:55.830 --> 00:23:57.580
take Yujin Jung to be my wife,

00:23:58.490 --> 00:24:02.870
to cherish and love forever.

00:24:05.750 --> 00:24:07.290
I, Yujin Jung,

00:24:08.000 --> 00:24:10.130
take Joonsang Kang to be my husband,

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:14.840
to cherish and love forever.

00:24:50.170 --> 00:24:51.460
Congratulations!

00:24:53.420 --> 00:24:56.680
Hey, congratulations, guys! You two really owe me!

00:25:02.310 --> 00:25:03.930
You're so beautiful, Yujin!

00:25:13.400 --> 00:25:14.950
Congratulations!

00:25:16.240 --> 00:25:17.280
Hurry up, dear!

00:25:17.410 --> 00:25:18.450
Yeah, yeah.

00:25:18.740 --> 00:25:20.700
Oh, hello. Sorry.

00:25:20.780 --> 00:25:21.540
Hurry up, dear!

00:25:21.620 --> 00:25:23.870
Man, why are you grabbing me while I'm eating?

00:25:26.960 --> 00:25:28.540
Now, if you'll turn and face me.

00:25:30.710 --> 00:25:31.920
Congratulations.

00:25:32.630 --> 00:25:35.260
Madam, if you'd take his arm.

00:25:36.760 --> 00:25:39.390
Yes, that's great.

00:25:39.720 --> 00:25:41.060
Here I go! One!

00:25:41.600 --> 00:25:42.770
{fad(40,0)\fax-0.13}One single photograph.

00:25:44.020 --> 00:25:44.930
Would we have met,

00:25:45.890 --> 00:25:48.730
if it hadn't been for that photograph?

00:25:55.070 --> 00:25:58.200
As time flows by, and everything becomes like a dream,

00:25:59.200 --> 00:26:00.910
will you remember me this way?

00:26:02.330 --> 00:26:06.500
Your Polaris will always be here.
